        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Softwood, stand establishment, tending, site development, under bark</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Softwood, stand establishment, tending, site development, under bark
The  volume refers to the wood not including the bark;
Synonyms: Spruce, Fichte; 
UUID: f8175bdf-6c28-33c3-93dd-f6cd989d0426
Includes motormanual processes for stand establishment, tending and site development for spruce and the land and material (including transports) use for the forest roads.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Considers only one type of forest interventions (Motormanual processes for "Fichte, I. Ertragsklasse, starke Durchforstung")
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f8175bdf-6c28-33c3-93dd-f6cd989d0426.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
